  <content contentuid="h05a0f4a7g72f5ga1c4gdfc9g5544417fa5d7" version="3">&lt;b&gt;Hey&lt;/b&gt;, help me get my lute back.</content>
  <content contentuid="h7b1b28b4gd85cg84a6g45bcg01087edbf6be" version="2">&lt;b&gt;No, &lt;/b&gt;Im going to get food</content>
  <content contentuid="h78a8c7bdg9dc1g6a57geabbged616fee1a47" version="2">&lt;b&gt;FINE, &lt;/b&gt;where is it?</content>
  <content contentuid="h9109fa90g72f1g2ba7ga94bg598c21b0c482" version="2">Its deep in the cave &lt;b&gt;behind me&lt;/b&gt;.</content>
  <content contentuid="h167fd2c3gf779gc2a9g4e31ge38902114802" version="1">XP GIVER</content>
  <content contentuid="hc3e4ca71g5747g1687g536bge25c4e1cde8c" version="13">Aye, if you're here for a song, I can't play you one. If not, piss off.</content>
  <content contentuid="h1a78bc78g41a0gf7b7g6096gf18833094b62" version="13">Why are you upset?</content>
  <content contentuid="h41a7c53cg3bfdgc4a0gc94bgb0dbf7aa2168" version="13">No need to be rude.</content>
  <content contentuid="h21f32846g0d64g87a1g7ac4g407b6d645f25" version="13">&lt;i&gt;(Piss off)&lt;/i&gt;</content>
  <content contentuid="h75b5b170gc59eg2cb6gcd03gf742fc0e4742" version="13">Upset?! Well, my lutes been stolen; my dearest Betsy has been ripped from my arms by an ugly, nasty, bugbear.</content>
  <content contentuid="h83f070b7g71bdg98ddg91fbgcc9c2d461455" version="13">He called my music bad and took her from me! That fleabag doesn't know music if it BIT HIM IN THE ARSE!</content>
  <content contentuid="h07465a4fg9f18g9fd0g5b06gacd0cc1349c2" version="13">Well, if you had the day I've HAD? You'd be upset too. Though, you do look and smell quite bad, that appears to be a normal thing for you lot.</content>
  <content contentuid="hf28cab75gd90eg45deg577cg39a37224655f" version="12">Do you need some help?</content>
  <content contentuid="hcdcfa1bcg080ag99deg3e13g6de8fb67c712" version="12">Sucks to be you.</content>
  <content contentuid="h5089d204g2d98g6bb5gfa37g5daf8367a749" version="12"> Hmm, maybe you can assist me. If you confront him with me, he will be so scared that he hands the lute back! HAHA! Full proof plan! I have some treasures from my village that I could give you for your troubles. How does that sound?</content>
  <content contentuid="hc71ff28cg4438gd187g02e4gc5e0d1f07920" version="12">Sure, let's do this!</content>
  <content contentuid="h40c51fc6g0c3cgad80g9f0agcc32597d9e03" version="12">Nevermind. </content>
  <content contentuid="h90dbf435g5a45g3f16gbb63g9ff9270a55c1" version="12">AHAHA! You're one of the good ones, I see! Well then, I last remember seeing him and his band wandering around northwest of the crash site. While we travel, I want to get your thoughts on a potential song I am working on!</content>
  <content contentuid="h774f4dc8g4231gc585gbaa8ge64188e5bf86" version="12">You bastard! You can't get a man's hopes up and then spit and stomp on it. Bug off then. If you actually care, then come back and find me. No good travelers, not good for anything.</content>
